# Routing on this machine

Which MCP server reaches which SAP system, and which one is allowed to do it. Copy this file to
`Projects/_routing.local.md` and fill it in. That path is gitignored, because a system id, a client
number and a customer name are exactly what must not enter the repository.

The agent reads this file before its first SAP call in a session. If it is missing, or does not
cover the system you are asking about, the agent must ask rather than guess.

